      "text": [
        "2136 - وَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : «إِنَّمَا جَعَلَ اَللَّهُ هَذَا اَلْأَضْحَى لِتَشْبَعَ مَسَاكِينُكُمْ مِنَ اَللَّحْمِ فَأَطْعِمُوهُمْ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2136 - The Messenger of Allah (swt), peace and blessings be upon him and his family, said: \"Allah (swt) made this sacrifice (Adha) so that your needy may be satisfied with meat, so feed them.\""
        ]
      }
